    <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class="hidden"></div><div id="block-miax-global-pl-content" class="block block-system block-system-main-block">
  
    
      
<article about="/company/about/history-of-growth" class="node node--type-promotional-page node--view-mode-full">

  
    

  
  <div class="node__content">
                    
  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--history-of-growth paragraph--view-mode--default">
					        

<section class="history-of-growth">
      

<nav aria-label="breadcrumb" class="container breadcrumb__container">
  <h2 id="system-breadcrumb" class="visually-hidden">Breadcrumb</h2>
  <ol class="breadcrumb">
          <li class="breadcrumb-item ">
                  <a href="/" >Home</a>
              </li>
          <li class="breadcrumb-item ">
                  <a href="/company/about" >About MIAX</a>
              </li>
          <li class="breadcrumb-item ">
                  <a href="/company/about/history-of-growth" >History of Growth</a>
              </li>
      </ol>
</nav>
    <h1>Our History of Growth</h1>
  <div class="history-of-growth-inner">
    <div class="date-container">
      <div class="gate gate-top"></div>
              <div class="year" data-year="2026"><h2>2026</h2></div>
              <div class="year" data-year="2025"><h2>2025</h2></div>
              <div class="year" data-year="2024"><h2>2024</h2></div>
              <div class="year" data-year="2023"><h2>2023</h2></div>
              <div class="year" data-year="2022"><h2>2022</h2></div>
              <div class="year" data-year="2020"><h2>2020</h2></div>
              <div class="year" data-year="2019"><h2>2019</h2></div>
              <div class="year" data-year="2017"><h2>2017</h2></div>
              <div class="year" data-year="2012"><h2>2012</h2></div>
            <div class="gate gate-bottom"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-container">
              <div class="year-container" data-year="2026">
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">January 21, 2026</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2026-01/miaxdx-sold-timeline-page-thumbnail-v1.0.png?itok=5mFE7beE" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">Miami International Holdings Completes Sale of MIAXdx, now Rothera, to Joint Venture Established by Robinhood Markets in Partnership with Susquehanna International Group</h3>
                <p>MIAX announces the sale of 90% of the issued and outstanding equity in MIAX Derivatives Exchange (MIAXdx™), to a joint venture established by Robinhood Markets, Inc. (Robinhood) (NASDAQ: HOOD) in partnership with Susquehanna International Group. The new exchange is called Rothera.</p>
              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>Our sale of MIAXdx reaffirms our strategy of partnering with industry leaders to accelerate our growth strategies and we’re pleased to gain exposure to the growing prediction market through our retained equity stake in the exchange.</p>
                                           </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Thomas P. Gallagher,
                     
                    <span class="source">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of MIH</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                  </div>
              <div class="year-container" data-year="2025">
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">June 30, 2025</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2025-07/miax-onyx-timeline-page-thumbnail-v1.1.png?itok=0PXgKMWa" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Launches the MIAX Futures Onyx Trading Platform</h3>
                <p>MIAX successfully launches MIAX Futures™ Onyx, a proprietary technology platform designed to power trading of agricultural and financial futures, and options on futures in geographically diverse locations.</p>
              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>Developed by our world-class technology team with the same proven systems that power our MIAX® exchanges, we believe that the MIAX Futures Onyx technology platform sets a new standard for fast, reliable trading technology for the futures industry.</p>
                                           </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Thomas P. Gallagher,
                     
                    <span class="source">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of MIH</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">June 06, 2025</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2025-07/tise-timeline-page-thumbnail-v1.0_0.jpg?itok=V2CYqWc9" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Acquires The International Stock Exchange (TISE)</h3>
                <p>MIAX expands its international footprint through the acquisition of The International Stock Exchange (TISE). Headquartered in Guernsey, Channel Islands, TISE provides financial markets and securities services to public and private companies.</p>
              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>MIAX’s acquisition of TISE represents a key milestone in advancing our international growth strategy.</p>
                                           </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Thomas P. Gallagher,
                     
                    <span class="source">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of MIH</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">March 12, 2025</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2022-10/bsx-2020.jpg?itok=ThC7zQiP" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX &amp; BSX Launch a New Trading and Settlement Platform</h3>
                <p>MIAX launched a fully-integrated trading, clearing, settlement and depository technology platform for The Bermuda Stock Exchange (BSX), utilizing MIAX proprietary trading, middle and back office technology with the CSD technology built in conjunction with Vermiculus.</p>
              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>The launch of the new BSX technology platform represents an important milestone in our strategy to build and operate all our exchanges utilizing proprietary MIAX technology.</p>
                                           </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Thomas P. Gallagher,
                     
                    <span class="source">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of MIH</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                  </div>
              <div class="year-container" data-year="2024">
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">September 18, 2024</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2024-10/bloomberg-timeline-page-thumbnail-v1.0.png?itok=REph_9Sx" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Announces Index Licensing Agreement with Bloomberg</h3>
                <p>The licensing agreement with Bloomberg Index Services Limited will support the development of a suite of index futures, options on futures, and cash options products based on its portfolio of benchmarks.</p>
              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>Our collaboration with Bloomberg Indices will provide the financial industry with access to a broad range of futures and options products designed to meet the needs of both retail and institutional equity investors. We are very encouraged with the long-term potential for our collaboration, particularly given the depth and breadth of Bloomberg’s global distribution capabilities and the growing trend of asset managers, funds, and other investors benchmarking to Bloomberg indices.</p>
                                           </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Thomas P. Gallagher,
                     
                    <span class="source">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of MIH</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">August 22, 2024</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2024-10/warburg-pincus-timeline-page-thumbnail-v1.0.png?itok=-_VWfCLF" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Secures Investment for Strategic Growth from Warburg Pincus</h3>
                <p>The investment by Warburg Pincus will accelerate the next phase of MIAX’s global expansion as it executes on its strategy of building a diversified revenue stream across multiple asset classes.</p>
              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>We are pleased to welcome Warburg Pincus as a strategic partner and look forward to leveraging its highly respected expertise and deep network of relationships in global financial services. The investment will provide MIH with additional funding to expand strategic partnerships in financial futures and proprietary products and will also provide capital to pursue acquisitions in the U.S. and internationally to accelerate our continued growth.</p>
                                           </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Thomas P. Gallagher,
                     
                    <span class="source">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of MIH</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">August 13, 2024</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2024-10/miax-sapphire-timeline-page-thumbnail-v1.0.png?itok=n37x1ag6" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Launches MIAX Sapphire</h3>
                <p>MIAX’s fourth options exchange utilizes Taker-Maker pricing and a Price-Time allocation model while leveraging MIAX-based technology and infrastructure with a physical trading floor launching in Miami, Florida in the second quarter of 2025.</p>
              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>MIAX’s expansion in the U.S. options space has been accomplished entirely through organic growth and the successful launch of four options exchanges since 2012 is a significant achievement for our company. The launch of the MIAX Sapphire electronic exchange is an important first step towards opening our state-of-the-art physical trading floor in Miami in 2025, and further expanding our presence in Florida.</p>
                                           </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Thomas P. Gallagher,
                     
                    <span class="source">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of MIH</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                  </div>
              <div class="year-container" data-year="2023">
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">May 19, 2023</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2024-10/ledgerx-timeline-page-thumbnail-v1.0%20%281%29.png?itok=0yzG9Ifh" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Completes Acquisition of LedgerX, now MIAXdx</h3>
                <p>MIAX expands its operations with the acquisition of CFTC-regulated exchange and clearinghouse, LedgerX, before changing it's name to MIAXdx.</p>
              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>The acquisition of LedgerX represents an important part of our growth strategy, expanding our ability to offer new and innovative products to the swaps and futures industry. We are pleased to complete this acquisition and welcome the LedgerX team to the MIH family as we continue to execute on our strategy of operating regulated financial markets both in the U.S. and internationally.</p>
                                           </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Thomas P. Gallagher,
                     
                    <span class="source">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of MIH</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                  </div>
              <div class="year-container" data-year="2022">
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">October 21, 2022</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2023-04/dorman-trading-website-milestone-thumbnail.jpg?itok=R2Af5rHW" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Acquires Dorman Trading, a Full-Service FCM</h3>
                <p>MIAX expands its U.S. Futures operations with the acquisition of CFTC-registered Futures Commission Merchant, Dorman Trading.</p>

              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>Dorman Trading is proud of the service-oriented, customer-centric business model we have used to provide clearing services to our customers for the past 40 years.&nbsp;We are excited to grow our capabilities and services as we embark on this next step in our history, combining Dorman Trading’s experience as an FCM with MIAX’s resources and vision.</p>

                                           <span>
                        <a href="https://www.tradersmagazine.com/am/miami-international-holdings-acquires-dorman-trading/"target="_blank">
                          Read more
                        </a>
                                              </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Daniel P. Dorman, Senior Vice President and Chief Operating Officer of Dorman Trading,
                     
                    <span class="source">Traders Magazine</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                  </div>
              <div class="year-container" data-year="2020">
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">December 18, 2020</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2022-10/bsx-2020.jpg?itok=ThC7zQiP" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Expands Globally through the Acquisition of The Bermuda Stock Exchange</h3>
                <p>BSX specializes in the listing and trading of capital market instruments such as equities, debt issues, funds, hedge funds, derivative warrants, and insurance linked securities.</p>

              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>Working alongside the MIH team during the past year has proven highly beneficial for both parties, and MIH’s decision to now acquire 100% ownership of BSX speaks to growth opportunities that MIH sees in our exchange. BSX is excited to add to the company’s bottom line and continued success.</p>

                                           <span>
                        <a href="https://bernews.com/2020/12/mih-acquires-100-ownership-bsx/"target="_blank">
                          Read more
                        </a>
                                              </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Greg Wojciechowski,
                     
                    <span class="source">Bernews</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">December 04, 2020</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2022-10/mgex-2020.jpg?itok=nWyOgxw4" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Acquires Full Ownership of Minneapolis Grain Exchange (MGEX™), now MIAX Futures</h3>
                <p>MIAX acquires a historically-recognized futures exchange, creating new access to clearing house services as a Designated Clearing Organization (DCO) and Derivatives Contract Market (DCM), and later renames it MIAX Futures.</p>
              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>When you’re leading an organization that’s been around for nearly 140 years, you do feel a sense of pride in that long history,” said Mark Bagan. “I’m very proud to preserve that.</p>

                                           <span>
                        <a href="https://www.startribune.com/the-last-of-its-kind-the-minneapolis-grain-exchange-is-being-sold/573069372/"target="_blank">
                          Read more
                        </a>
                                              </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Kavita Kumar,
                     
                    <span class="source">Star Tribune</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">September 29, 2020</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2022-10/pearl-equities-2020.jpg?itok=hkYnp_xH" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Expands into Equities with MIAX Pearl Equities Launch</h3>
                <p>MIAX launched its first equities exchange, MIAX Pearl® Equities, leveraging the technology built for our options exchanges and offering trading in U.S. cash equities with price-time allocation and maker-taking pricing.</p>
              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>This caps an incredibly exciting few weeks that included the announced plan of merger with the Minneapolis Grain Exchange and the successful closing of a strategic equity rights transaction for MIAX Pearl Equities,” Douglas M. Schafer, Jr., executive vice president and chief information officer of MIH, said. “We look forward to our member firms experiencing the performance, reliability, customer service and low-cost that MIAX Pearl Equities brings to the equities marketplace.</p><p><a href="https://apnews.com/press-release/pr-newswire/north-america-miami-florida-leo-anthony-gallagher-united-states-f03b024cb71da806ecb6c666950b9003" target="_blank">Read More</a></p>
                                           </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Douglas M. Schafer, Jr.,
                     
                    <span class="source">Executive Vice President and Chief Information Officer, MIH</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                  </div>
              <div class="year-container" data-year="2019">
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">March 01, 2019</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2022-10/emerald-2019.jpg?itok=SRonA5DA" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Launches MIAX Emerald</h3>
                <p>MIAX’s third options exchange, MIAX Emerald®, provides a pro-rata allocation and maker-taker pricing model, and with its launch provides MIAX with access to 88% of total U.S. options market volume.</p>

              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>OCC congratulates the Miami International Securities Exchange on the successful launch of MIAX Emerald.</p>

                                           <span>
                        <a href="https://www.theocc.com/Newsroom/Press-Releases/2019/03-04-OCC-Welcomes-MIAX-Emerald-Options-Exchange"target="_blank">
                          Read more
                        </a>
                                              </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - John Davidson, OCC chief executive officer,
                     
                    <span class="source">Press Release, OCC</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                  </div>
              <div class="year-container" data-year="2017">
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">February 06, 2017</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2022-10/pearl-options-2017.jpg?itok=rvDiualp" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX Launches MIAX Pearl </h3>
                <p>MIAX's second fully-electronic options exchange, MIAX Pearl® serves as a counterpart to MIAX Options by providing a price-time allocation and maker-taker pricing model while leveraging our award-winning technology platform.</p>
              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>OCC congratulates the Miami International Securities Exchange on the successful launch of MIAX Pearl,” Craig Donohue, OCC executive chairman and CEO, said. “We are pleased to provide central counterparty clearing and settlement services to our newest participant exchange. As a Systemically Important Financial Market Utility and the foundation for secure markets, we look forward to the continued success of MIAX Pearl and continued growth of the U.S. exchange-traded options industry.</p>

                                           <span>
                        <a href="https://www.tradersmagazine.com/departments/options/miax-pearl-optons-exchange-opens/"target="_blank">
                          Read more
                        </a>
                                              </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Editorial Staff,
                     
                    <span class="source">Traders Magazine</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                  </div>
              <div class="year-container" data-year="2012">
                      <div class="timeline-item">
              <span class="date">December 07, 2012</span>
                                            <img src="https://www.miaxglobal.com/sites/default/files/styles/history_of_growth/public/2023-01/launch-2012.jpg?itok=BvrQ1Bx5" alt="">
                            <div class="content-copy">
                <h3 class="h5">MIAX® Launches its First Fully-Electronic Options Exchange</h3>
                <p style="line-height:1.2">MIAX launched MIAX Options®, its first fully-electronic options exchange for the trading of OCC-issued standardized options on equities and ETFs.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

              </div>
                              <div class="quote">
                  <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
                  <div class="quote-text"><p>The approval of the MIAX Options Exchange is a significant milestone,” Thomas P. Gallagher, the company’s chairman and chief executive officer, said in a statement. “We are excited to enter into the U.S. options space and commence trading.</p>

                                           <span>
                        <a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2012-12-04/miami-options-exchange-gets-sec-approval-will-start-dec-7"target="_blank">
                          Read more
                        </a>
                                              </span>
                    </div>
                  <p>
                                          - Nina Mehta,
                     
                    <span class="source">Bloomberg</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
                          </div>
                  </div>
          </div>
  </div>
</section>
						</div>

              

  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--prefooter-cta paragraph--view-mode--default" >
          



